    "The number is average forecast deviation from measured temperature, not an integration fault. Ratings are practical guidance. Color requires at least 20 comparisons. Green also requires beating the no-change benchmark.": "Číslo je priemerná odchýlka, nie porucha. Vodidlo; farba po 20 porovnaniach, zelená aj lepšia než stála referencia.",
